      "side": 1,
      "message": "`go.sum` should update for you any time you run `go build src/wpr.go` or `go run src/wpr.go`. When I tried these commmands on a fresh checkout, I got a message telling me:\n```\nsrc/wpr.go:24:2: missing go.sum entry for module providing package golang.org/x/net/http2; to add:\n\tgo mod download golang.org/x/net\n```\nand then the same for `.../x/text`, and then go asking me to run `go mod tidy` which added the trailing 0 on the version (that has changed in standardization I guess).\n\nWhen we build out CQ for this repo, I\u0027m hoping we can add some checks to make sure these things are part of a PRESUBMIT.",
      "parentUuid": "1e61591f_00cac60f",
      "revId": "0f92f2b94ab5ec22c00b0ad439d91adba66b3281",
